PURPOSE of /kernel/hwdata/Sanity/example
Description: Example sanity script to print pci/usb device id's
Author: Rachel Sibley <rasibley@redhat.com>

Description:
This script is used to provide an example of user readable usb and pci
device id's. This script is a quick sanity check to verify the usb/pci's
are printed correctly as a result of bz 1380159. In addition, reinstall
the hwdata and python-hwdata pkgs to ensure there are no failures.
